          {
           "name": "text",
           "type": "string",
           "value": "is survivor's ability to bring\nback other downed ones if they\nhave at least 3 rings and the\nmore rings you have - the faster\nthe revival is,each survivor\ncan be revived only once and\nregain two hp upon doing so,\nsurvivors have 30 seconds to\nget revived,timer will slow\ndown if exe is near to the body.\nseveral players can revive one\nplayer,in that case ressurection\nwill be faster and will take\naway required rings from all \nressurecting players.if several\nbodies are close to each other -\nthey can be revived at once"
