          {
           "name": "text",
           "type": "string",
           "value": "is decided by the size,amount \nof traps and branching of the\nmap,\u2116medium maps ~have 180   \nseconds of minimal time.@easy\nmaps ~have a lot of space and\nmore ways to escape,but      \nsurvivors have to survive for\n25 seconds longer.\\hard maps \n~take 25 seconds less,but    \nusually are small or filled  \nwith traps.&madness maps     \n~also have shorten minimal   \ntime but also shorten time  \nbonus for each new player"
